lues":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102595","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102595","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102595.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102595.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nAn implementation of favoriting assets, based on https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3521 and https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11080. This: \r\n- Adds a Star button to the right of AssetLibraryItems, toggling the Asset's favorite status.\r\n- Adds a `Favorites...` button next to the search bar, opening a popup with the list of favorited assets.\r\n- Stores favorites data in an editor setting `asset_library/favorites`, which is a Dictionary. \r\n  - Keys are the asset_id as an int. Values are a Dictionary, caching the minimum info needed to spawn an AssetLibraryItem in the favorites list.\r\n- Syncs the favorite status of an asset's star button by listening to and emitting `settings_changed` in EditorSettings.\r\n- Shows `template_only` assets only from the project manager, and the others only from the editor.","closed_by":{"login":"dugramen","id":54819319,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODE5MzE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54819319?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen","html_url":"https://github.com/dugramen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dugramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.